stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> queued: created (server)
    queued --> running: starts (worker)
    queued --> failed: never started (server)
    queued --> stopped: run_stop (server)
    running --> paused: live run at t0, pause,<br/>end of a step (worker)
    paused --> running: resume, step (worker)
    paused --> stopped: stop, run_stop,<br/>idle limit
    paused --> failed: worker_lost (server)
    running --> failed: error or timeout (worker),<br/>worker_lost (server)
    running --> finished: completes or ends early (worker)
    running --> stopped: stop, run_stop
    stopped --> [*]
    finished --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
